            "review_text": "Yangyang\n25 contributions\n0\nWorst food place to have a meal\nJan 2020 • Friends\nWe sat down and ordered then a couple sat down on the table beside us. The food came and the male waiter gave it to them first. The guy from the other table ate a few bites and the female waitress realised the mistake! It was my dish. The male waiter took the plate and added more rice..... to make it seem like it wasn’t eaten into before... wow They really thought I couldn’t see the kitchen and what was going o.... I didn’t want to make a scene so I paid for it and left... \n\nReally upset. They could have give me a new dish but did not. They could have apologise but did not. They could have done so much more to make the situation better but did not... \n\nThey are all in their teens... and did not work professionally at all...\nRead more\nWritten January 8, 2020",
