            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nKnown for Ribs - But Great Overall Menu\nDec 2018 • Solo\nI really loved the atmosphere - not because it is a fancy restaurant or anything but because there were both families and school kids (probably university students). Everyone seemed to be so upbeat and cheerful. The food was really delicious too. I had a lunch set which came with rice, grilled pork, and a vegetable soup. I sat up on the fourth floor (I think) which gave me a great view of the busy Giang Vo while I ate. \n\nI really loved what I got though other people told me that I really need to return for the ribs. Easy! I can do it this week!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 9, 2018",
